+## P12-01/P12-02 correction
+
+Both exact reviewer reproductions failed before this fix: an unrelated source/empty grant/real-provider action descriptor was accepted, and rehashed before-process qualification plus false JAR/version/runtime claims were accepted. The new focused regression tests now refuse both, plus individual field mutations; the exact original legitimate packet remains admissible without state writes.
+
+Task admission checks the independently registered root task source/reference and exact bounded synthetic action set, including duplicate/empty/expanded-action refusal. It binds owner/session/root, selected pins, composition and artifact, and retains unavailable named-profile/approval-policy values as unavailable. These checks do not turn JSON or controls into human authority; independent root/grant verification remains separate.
