+
+Initial qualification has no rolling clock-only lease: validity is the explicitly documented same live birth/source/JAR/health identity while this user-requested preview runs. Before-process/future/expired claims refuse; elapsed age is not silently presented as a new qualification. Stopped identities remain refused. A recorded assertion count is not independently repeated consumer acceptance.
+
+Qualification files/start logs/descriptors now use unique run-specific names, preserving every prior packet. The current live f77 app and mock remain their actual original processes/code; this correction is not claimed as loaded into them. The application artifact and selected input scope are unchanged. A fresh owned packet/runtime readback at the new immutable producer pin will be supplied for independent12 review before58 state-writing admission; safe cutover preserves old state/receipts and only stops owned birth-verified processes.
